{"id":"3bf0fbe848a49bdc","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0.md","title":"thm-parity-not-in-ac0 (PARITY not in AC0)","display":"thm-parity-not-in-ac0 (PARITY not in AC0)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ac0]]","[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-depth]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"display":"thm-parity-not-in-ac0 (PARITY not in AC0)","label":"28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0","PARITY not in AC0","PARITY lower bound"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.1 and §14.1.1","source_printed_pages":"287–289","source_pdf_pages":"313–315","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51d96e53efebc2d6\" href=\"?note=51d96e53efebc2d6\" title=\"28-df-ac0\">28-df-ac0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-parity-not-in-ac0 (PARITY not in AC0)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0</span><span>PARITY not in AC0</span><span>PARITY lower bound</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.1 and §14.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"287–289"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"313–315"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{AC}^0\">\\(\\mathbf{AC}^0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\coloneqq(\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i)\\bmod2,\\qquad \\mathsf{PARITY}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\operatorname{par}_{|x|}(x)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\coloneqq(\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i)\\bmod2,\\qquad \\mathsf{PARITY}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\operatorname{par}_{|x|}(x)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PARITY}\\notin\\mathbf{AC}^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PARITY}\\notin\\mathbf{AC}^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists n_0\\ \\forall n\\ge n_0\\ \\forall C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\ [(\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{size}(C)&gt;(n+1)^a].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall d,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists n_0\\ \\forall n\\ge n_0\\ \\forall C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\ [(\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{size}(C)&gt;(n+1)^a].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>后式记录书中随机限制论证给出的最终逐长度下界；一般语言不在 AC⁰ 仅给出无穷多长度的障碍，故不把两个式子当作仅由逻辑得到的等价。已复核 §14.1.1 中由 switching lemma 推出下界的论证；未逐项复核 §14.1.2 的全部编码估计。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.1 and §14.1.1，印刷页 287–289；PDF 页 313–315。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：switching lemma全部编码估计尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ac0","status":"resolved","id":"51d96e53efebc2d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ac0]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{AC}^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\coloneqq(\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i)\\bmod2,\\qquad \\mathsf{PARITY}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\operatorname{par}_{|x|}(x)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PARITY}\\notin\\mathbf{AC}^0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall d,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists n_0\\ \\forall n\\ge n_0\\ \\forall C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\ [(\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle\\operatorname{par}_n(x)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{size}(C)>(n+1)^a].","display":true}],"bytes":2023,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"下界工具：[[28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-switching-restriction]]、[[28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0]]。"}],"outgoing":["51d96e53efebc2d6","7776a98a623ada8d","f62ab4c80ccedf7e","14f69cc09dc02600"]}